  "description": "Osama bin Laden was the founder and leader of the terrorist organization al-Qaeda. He was responsible for orchestrating the September 11, 2001 attacks on the United States, which killed nearly 3,000 people. He was widely regarded as one of the most wanted terrorists in history and was killed in a U.S. military operation in Pakistan in 2011. His image is globally recognized and associated with terrorism, extremism, and global conflict.",
